104
00:07:34,650 --> 00:07:36,250
Get out of the way !

105
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,530
Go ! Quick !

106
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,410
With the fall of the Guardian Azure Dragon,

107
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:52,610
