118
00:09:58,560 --> 00:10:00,010
This domain...

119
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:10,090
I didn't expect to see you here,

120
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:11,170
Brother Wang.

121
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:25,690
This Rain Cauldron is too precious

122
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:28,090
