123
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:31,250
It's too precious for our Four Sect Alliance.

124
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,810
If you want it, you can take it.

125
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,490
But whether you can keep it

126
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:39,290
will depend on your own luck.

127
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,080
Take one pill per day

128
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,570
and you will recover.

129
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,330
With the Rain Cauldron in hand,

130
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,650
I have to get out of here.

131
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,250
This is bad !

132
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,570
The remnants of the Four Sect Alliance,

133
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:12,690
Lian Ning 
Xue Yue Elder
Early stage Soul Formation

134
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:12,890
must die !

135
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,370
Explode !

136
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,410
I won't let you leave !

137
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:08,780
Although she is Soul Formation,

138
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:11,410
her physical body is not necessarily strong.

139
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:13,050
With Ancient God blood,

140
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,890
I might have a chance.

141
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:30,890
This Nascent Soul puppet of yours

142
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:33,170
is pretty interesting.

143
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:45,810
Explode !

144
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:51,250
If I don't escape now,

145
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,970
it will only get harder in the future.

146
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:57,050
The only way to end this quickly

147
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,290
is a tribulation.

148
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:22,730
This is...

149
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:24,970
Divine Retribution !

150
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:34,770
How can a Nascent Soul brat

151
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:36,450
summon such a tribulation !?

152
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:42,890
Fall !

153
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:12,170
I am Ou Zhi from Suzaku.

154
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:15,210
Fellow cultivator, please summon the tribulation again !

155
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:17,770
I will reward you generously !

156
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:22,650
It really was Divine Retribution...

157
00:14:22,620 --> 00:14:23,610
Fellow cultivator,

158
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:25,690
are you willing to show yourself ?

159
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:27,690
Killing this one Soul Formation

160
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:29,570
consumed all my artifacts.

161
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,290
I must not interfere

162
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:33,010
with the country of Suzaku.

163
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:38,610
The fall of the Guardian Azure Dragon

164
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:41,090
signed the end of the Four Sect Alliance.

165
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:43,810
The country was destroyed.

166
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,170
In the following years,

167
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:52,050
the remaining cultivators of the Four Sects Alliance almost all perished.

168
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:54,330
Those who survived

169
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:56,130
must hide their identity

170
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:59,090
in the new Xue Yue country

171
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:01,770
in order to survive.

172
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:09,410
5 years later

173
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:17,690
After absorbing the earth spirit,

174
00:15:17,470 --> 00:15:19,170
the earth element has been completed.

175
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,990
Now the Heaven Defying Bead

176
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:24,330
has a bit of spiritual energy inside it.

177
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:27,610
These 5 elemental lights have hints of Life.

178
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:30,430
The Heaven Defying Bead

179
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:32,290
must have uses I have yet to discover.

180
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,970
I have to complete the 5 elements first.

181
00:15:35,380 --> 00:15:38,210
Only then will the bead recognize me as its master

182
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:40,530
and maybe reveal its other powers.

183
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,370
To cultivate the Life and Death Domain,

184
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:46,690
the time alteration of the Heaven Defying Bead

185
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:48,570
is useless.

186
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,890
After 5 years, I cannot stay inside any longer.

187
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:53,690
I still need 4 years

188
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:56,250
before I can step into Soul Formation.

189
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:05,250
New Xue Yue

190
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,290
In just 5 years,

191
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:11,250
Xue Yue has developed to this point.

192
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,210
This is...

193
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:56,970
A death aura ?

194
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:59,170
There are many mortals here,

195
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:01,730
they should be brimming with life.

196
00:17:02,070 --> 00:17:05,450
So why is this death aura so prevalent ?

197
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:20,910
I've had my share of wounds,

198
00:17:18,820 --> 00:17:20,910
now I want to fight back.

199
00:17:20,740 --> 00:17:24,470
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

200
00:17:24,300 --> 00:17:30,390
that's blocking all my hopes

201
00:17:27,180 --> 00:17:30,390
for life ?

202
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:36,150
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

203
00:17:33,660 --> 00:17:36,150
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

204
00:17:36,220 --> 00:17:39,550
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

205
00:17:39,660 --> 00:17:45,550
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

206
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:45,550
out of reach.

207
00:17:46,660 --> 00:17:51,030
Immortals

208
00:17:47,700 --> 00:17:51,030
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

209
00:17:51,060 --> 00:17:55,070
Renegades

210
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:55,070
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

211
00:17:54,820 --> 00:17:58,910
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

212
00:17:56,770 --> 00:17:58,910
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

213
00:17:58,900 --> 00:18:03,030
because I don't see the harm in that.

214
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:10,830
My new body opens its eyes

215
00:18:07,300 --> 00:18:10,830
and awakens from its dream.

216
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:18,390
I have overcome many trials

217
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:18,390
to get this body back.

218
00:18:18,340 --> 00:18:26,030
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

219
00:18:22,380 --> 00:18:26,030
I can still see.

220
00:18:26,180 --> 00:18:35,390
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

221
00:18:30,140 --> 00:18:35,390
by my own hands.

222
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:12,230
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

223
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:12,230
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

224
00:19:11,980 --> 00:19:19,790
With a flick of a finger,

225
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:19,790
only my indomitable heart remains.

226
00:19:19,580 --> 00:19:29,190
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

227
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:29,190
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

228
00:19:29,180 --> 00:19:37,030
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

229
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:37,030
like the descent of a god.
